    "cooking_steps": [
        "In a large bowl, whisk together gram flour, semolina, grated ginger, chopped green chilies, lemon juice, salt, and water to make a smooth batter. Add more water if needed, aiming for a slightly thick consistency.",
        "Lightly grease a flat, shallow baking dish or steamer with oil. Pour the batter into the prepared dish.",
        "Steam for 20-25 minutes or until the khaman is firm to the touch. Once done, let it cool down for about 5 minutes before slicing and serving."
    ],
